# Child tax credit from the household (difftest scaffold)

> Using Types
> Using Eitc as E
> Using Ctc_odc as C

This scope exists for `make difftest SCOPE=ctc_odc_household` and as the
reference for the wiring the orchestrator adds to the return (issue #27):
`Ctc_odc.CtcOdcDependents` counts the CTC and ODC dependents of the household
(Schedule 8812 lines 4 and 6), and `Ctc_odc.Schedule8812` computes lines 14
and 27 from those counts. The household members and the filer facts come
from `oracle/persons.csv`; the return figures are inputs taken from the
oracle, and in the full return come from `Form1040`, `Form_w2s.FormW2s`,
`Eitc.EarnedIncomeCredit` and the CDCC, Saver's and Schedule R modules.

```catala
declaration scope CtcOdcFromHousehold:
  # ---- Ctc_odc.CtcOdcDependents inputs ----
  input household_members content list of C.HouseholdMember
  input minimum_filer_date_of_birth content date
  input treat_filers_as_dependents content boolean
  input either_filer_us_citizen_or_national content boolean
  input treat_as_mfj content boolean
  # ---- Ctc_odc.Schedule8812 inputs other than the two counts ----
  input filing_status content Types.FilingStatus
  input agi content money
  input total_tentative_tax content money
  input cdcc_total_credit content money
  input qualified_saver_credit_amount content money
  input total_edc content money
  input employer_income_subtotal content money
  input all_combat_pay content money
  input social_security_taxes_withheld content money
  input earned_income_credit content money
  input received_improper_claims content boolean
  input received_improper_claims_notice content E.ImproperClaimsNotice
  input improper_claims_notice_expired content boolean
  input has_filed_ctc_odc_since_notice_expired content boolean

  internal household content C.CtcOdcDependents
  internal schedule content C.Schedule8812

  output ctc_eligible_dependents content integer
  output odc_eligible_dependents content integer
  output total_potential_ctc content money
  output total_potential_odc content money
  output total_ctc_and_odc content money
  output total_potential_actc content money
  output three_or_more_ctc_eligible_dependents condition
  output additional_ctc content money

scope CtcOdcFromHousehold:
  definition household equals
    output of C.CtcOdcDependents with {
      -- household_members: household_members
      -- minimum_filer_date_of_birth: minimum_filer_date_of_birth
      -- treat_filers_as_dependents: treat_filers_as_dependents
      -- either_filer_us_citizen_or_national:
           either_filer_us_citizen_or_national
      -- treat_as_mfj: treat_as_mfj }
  definition schedule equals
    output of C.Schedule8812 with {
      -- ctc_eligible_dependents: household.ctc_eligible_dependents
      -- odc_eligible_dependents: household.odc_eligible_dependents
      -- filing_status: filing_status
      -- agi: agi
      -- total_tentative_tax: total_tentative_tax
      -- cdcc_total_credit: cdcc_total_credit
      -- qualified_saver_credit_amount: qualified_saver_credit_amount
      -- total_edc: total_edc
      -- employer_income_subtotal: employer_income_subtotal
      -- all_combat_pay: all_combat_pay
      -- social_security_taxes_withheld: social_security_taxes_withheld
      -- earned_income_credit: earned_income_credit
      -- received_improper_claims: received_improper_claims
      -- received_improper_claims_notice: received_improper_claims_notice
      -- improper_claims_notice_expired: improper_claims_notice_expired
      -- has_filed_ctc_odc_since_notice_expired:
           has_filed_ctc_odc_since_notice_expired }
  definition ctc_eligible_dependents equals household.ctc_eligible_dependents
  definition odc_eligible_dependents equals household.odc_eligible_dependents
  definition total_potential_ctc equals schedule.total_potential_ctc
  definition total_potential_odc equals schedule.total_potential_odc
  definition total_ctc_and_odc equals schedule.total_ctc_and_odc
  definition total_potential_actc equals schedule.total_potential_actc
  rule three_or_more_ctc_eligible_dependents under condition
    schedule.three_or_more_ctc_eligible_dependents
  consequence fulfilled
  definition additional_ctc equals schedule.additional_ctc
```
